All 15 tests under `tests/` now pass cleanly without modifying any test files or using skips.

### Changes Summary

- **`src/auth.py`**
  - Updated `has_permission` to make the permission check case-insensitive.
  - Corrected `is_admin_or_owner` to use `or` instead of `and` so that matching `owner_id` or being an `admin` grants access.

- **`src/inventory.py`**
  - Fixed mutable default argument in `__init__` (`initial` now defaults to `None` and maps to a new dictionary instance, preventing shared state between `Inventory` objects).
  - Fixed `add` to accumulate quantities correctly.
  - Adjusted the reservation threshold check in `reserve` from `qty >= self.available(...)` to `qty > self.available(...)` to allow reserving up to the available quantity.
  - Implemented `release` check to raise `ValueError` when attempting to release more quantity than is currently reserved.

- **`src/text_utils.py`**
  - Updated `slugify` to convert `text` to lowercase and collapse repeated separators properly using a while loop.
  - Adjusted `truncate` to correctly limit the length of the string to `max_len` including the length of the `suffix`.
